# Backend architecture work

Use [architecture.md](../../docs/architecture.md) for durable invariants and
[the architecture Skill](../../.agents/skills/forgeai-architecture/SKILL.md) for change guidance.
Read [the artifact reference](../../.agents/skills/forgeai-architecture/reference.md) only when an
artifact producer, consumer, meaning, or compatibility contract is affected.

Derive current routes, states, stages, schemas, storage, and agent behavior from the implementation
and tests. Work on the current approved increment without prebuilding a fixed later sequence.

Review changed files first, then their direct callers, imports, contracts, persistence, runtime and
security boundaries, and related tests. Expand only when a shared or cross-cutting impact justifies
it; do not rescan the entire backend for each task.
